            "m_dialogEntries": [
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>As you begin reading the Journal, you can almost hear Malistaire's voice. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/QuestButtons/Use_WC_Open_Book.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Narrator_MIR_14.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Malistaire's Journal",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>My efforts to resurrect Sylvia have met no success, but I've heard of a mysterious group of Scholars called the Cabal. They may know a way. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Malistaire_Ghost_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Malistaire_MIR_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Malistaire's Journal",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>This Cabal lives up to its reputation. They communicate through a masked agent who goes only by the initials G and D. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Malistaire_Ghost_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Malistaire_MIR_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Malistaire's Journal",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>Nervous as it makes me to deal with this Cabal, they claim to have the answers I seek. What choice do I have? I meet them tonight. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Malistaire_Ghost_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Malistaire_MIR_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Malistaire's Journal",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>In exchange for information, the Cabal demands I give them the Eye of History. They plan to take it to the world of Mirage. I know not why. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Malistaire_Ghost_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Malistaire_MIR_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Malistaire's Journal",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>I am conflicted. I fear what the Cabal's intentions in Mirage may be, but I've come too far to turn back now... </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Malistaire_Ghost_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Malistaire_MIR_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Malistaire's Journal",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>I made the exchange. The secret to resurrecting Sylvia lies within an ancient tome known as the Krokonomicon. To Krokotopia, I go. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Malistaire_Ghost_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Malistaire_MIR_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS>You close the Journal, and place it in your backpack. Headmaster Ambrose needs to see this. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/QuestButtons/Use_WC_Open_Book.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Narrator_MIR_15.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Duncan Grimwater",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "So it's you - the Headmaster's little pet. Been a long time, but I always knew we'd cross paths again. You've grown in power... I have too.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02_MOB.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DuncanGrimwater_MIR_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Duncan Grimwater",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "My associates now make Ambrose look like a hedge wizard. Perhaps you've heard of... the Cabal? They have agents everywhere - even Wizard City.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02_MOB.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DuncanGrimwater_MIR_02.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Duncan Grimwater",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "After this, I'll be a full-fledged member. See, they detected an intruder here and sent me. That journal's not going anywhere... neither are you!",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Art_Portrait_Boy_Death02_MOB.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/DuncanGrimwater_MIR_03.mp3",
